==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|раз-|дать|-ся}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|разда́ться}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-раздаться.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|разда́ться|pf|impf=раздава́ться}}

# to [[sound]], to [[ring out]] (usually unexpectedly), to [[go off]] (e.g. telephone, gunshot)
#: {{ux|ru|[[вдруг|Вдруг]] '''разда́лся''' [[вы́стрел]].|t=Suddenly, a shot '''rang out'''.}}
# {{lb|ru|dated}} to [[give way]], to make way; to move aside
# to [[expand]], to become wide; to gain weight
#: {{ux|ru|[[твой|Твой]] [[муж]] заме́тно '''разда́лся''' [[в]] [[плечо|плеча́х]].|t=Your husband got considerably wider in the shoulders.}}
# {{infl of|ru|разда́ть||pass}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|irreg/c''|разда́ться}}
